// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`workflow inspect run <id> --usage > prints a readable summary 1`] = `
"Usage for wrun_<RUN_ID> (completed)

37 billable events · 1 retry (+2 events)

Where the events come from
  sendEmail drives 24% of this run's events (9 events).

  Span           Events  Share  Retries
  sendEmail           9    24%
  chargeCard          5    14%        1
  audit0              3     8%
  audit1              3     8%
  audit2              3     8%
  5 other spans      14    38%

Each step writes 3 events (created, started, completed); each retry adds 2.

Data written
  Run        818 B
  Steps    9.19 KB
  Hooks      638 B
  Streams  2.05 KB
  Total    12.7 KB

Not your final bill. See pricing: https://vercel.com/docs/workflows/pricing"
`;

